- §10 Proposed MSSQL Tables: remove InfobipProvisioningJob (never built;
  per-row LastSyncAt/LastError + app logs cover its use case)
- Add InfobipWhatsappTemplate table to back the currently passthrough
  /api/WhatsappTemplates surface: list/search, Meta lifecycle tracking,
  24h-cooldown + 10-edits/month gates, soft-duplicate detection via
  ContentHash
- Document duplicate-template handling: hard duplicate (same Name +
  Language on a sender) is rejected upstream and surfaced unchanged;
  same name across languages is allowed; same structure across
  different names is allowed but flagged via ContentHash
- Mirror changes in hermes-infobip-provisioning-plan.md (status table,
  §3 new tables block, InfobipProvisioningService note)
---
