@@ -538,7 +548,7 @@ mindmap
             <tr><td><code>InfobipApplication</code> <b>(enriched)</b></td><td>Use case → Infobip <code>applicationId</code> binding (one row per Hermes use case, e.g. Speed2Lead). Now also carries the human-readable <code>ApplicationName</code>, default channel, callback URL, and last-sync diagnostics so the bootstrap idempotency check has somewhere to write its result.</td><td><code>ApplicationId</code>, <code>ApplicationName</code>, <code>UseCase</code>, <code>DefaultChannel</code>, <code>Status</code>, <code>IsDefault</code>, <code>CallbackUrl</code>, <code>LastSyncAt</code>, <code>LastError</code></td></tr>
